  "description": "Go Miso, a beautiful influencer admired by everyone. Paeng Miso, the girl who has always wanted to be like her.\n\nOne fateful day, a strange being in a closed-down school bathroom offers a ten-day deal. Paeng Miso borrows Go Miso’s body—and steps into the world she’s always dreamed of.\n\nThe lights, the applause, the love…all finally within reach. But as the days pass, desire turns into obsession. Paeng Miso begins searching for a way to keep living as Go Miso—no matter the cost.\n\nBecause to have everything… she must give up everything.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=842624), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13098964)\n\n**Official Translations:**   \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0004321)",
